  "id": "perceptual-cues",
  "term": "perceptual cues",
  "definition": "Perceptual cues are selected features of a situation or environment that are taken in through perception and can trigger emotional reactions. In virtual reality, they are the aspects of the simulated setting used to make the experience feel real enough to evoke responses such as fear.",
